    "sections": {
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.16</h4>\n<h4>1.0.15</h4>\n<p>New options to run custom scripts on events from optifile online. as on change of appointmenttype, commit appointment, changing an appointment and canceling an appointment.</p>\n<h4>1.0.14</h4>\n<p>WordPress update seems not to be availible, retry with new version</p>\n<h4>1.0.13</h4>\n<p>tested on 6.8.3</p>\n<h4>1.0.12</h4>\n<p>templates folder was uploaded with uppercase Templates, this would throw critical exception on unix/linus wordpress versions, no problems on windows editions</p>\n<h4>1.0.11</h4>\n<p>fix error in setting page</p>\n<h4>1.0.10</h4>\n<p>Small script fix</p>\n<h4>1.0.9</h4>\n<p>Fixes missing files</p>\n<h4>1.0.8</h4>\n<p>Small fixes</p>\n<h4>1.0.7</h4>\n<p>Small fixes</p>\n<h4>1.0.6</h4>\n<p>Small fixes</p>\n<h4>1.0.5</h4>\n<p>Small fixes</p>\n<h4>1.0.4</h4>\n<p>Small fixes</p>\n<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<p>verion 1.0.0 has wrong source in tag folder</p>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<p>Fixed error on admin setting page</p>\n<h4>0.2</h4>\n<p>ShortCode fixed for use in newer WordPress versions.<br />\nnewappointment page fixed if not logged in link not working<br />\nmessages showing on newappointment page fixed<br />\njquery support required fixed</p>\n<h4>0.0</h4>\n<p>First version</p>\n",
        "description": "<p>Deze plugin kan worden gebruikt om Optifile Online te integreren op uw website</p>\n"
    },
